## Method

Each probe applied an exact text edit with a script that fails when the old text count is wrong.
Each probe then ran one vitest command through heavy-run.sh, and reverted with git checkout.
The script printed TREE CLEAN after every revert. The script is saved as adversarial-da99c46-probes.py (labels P1 to P11).
P12, P13, and P14 need no edit. Raw tool output stayed in /tmp and is quoted below.

Target files for P1 to P8: www-batch-20261116.locale, storytime-advantage/page.content, blog-posts-validation.
P0 (baseline, no edit): 3 files, 109 tests, all pass at da99c46c7.

